---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import data from "../content/en/index.json";
const { join, links } = data;
---
<Page title="Join the Lab – PopGen Lab" lang="en" locale="en" description="Join the PopGen Lab — MSc, PhD, and postdoc positions in computational population genetics at Université de Montréal.">
  <section class="py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Join the Lab</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg">{join.pitch}</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What We Do</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          The PopGen Lab is a fully computational research group working at the intersection of population genetics,
          evolutionary biology, statistics, and computer science. Our projects focus on building quantitative tools
          to understand how populations are shaped by history, geography, and demography.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Research in the lab is inherently interdisciplinary. Students come from backgrounds in bioinformatics,
          computational biology, computer science, statistics, genetics, and evolutionary biology, and bring
          different ways of thinking about data, models, and biological questions.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li>Developing statistical and computational methods</li>
          <li>Working with large-scale genomic and genealogical datasets</li>
          <li>Designing and running simulations of evolutionary and demographic processes</li>
          <li>Building visualizations and exploratory analyses to understand complex structure</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          Most projects involve substantial coding and quantitative reasoning. While prior experience with programming
          is important, students arrive with different strengths, and projects are shaped to build on both biological
          insight and technical skill.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-r-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Current Opportunities</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          {join.cta}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Program Links</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {links.map((l) => (
            <a
              href={l.url}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-4 py-2 border border-primary text-primary rounded hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition text-sm"
            >
              {l.label}
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>